<title>USA: Sparks pegs US winter wheat output at 1.576 bln bu.</title>
<headline>Sparks pegs US winter wheat output at 1.576 bln bu.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sparks Companies pegged 1997 U.S. winter wheat production at 1.576 billion bushels on Thursday, up 15 million bushels from the previous estimate, trade sources said.</p>
<p>A spokesman for the Memphis-based analytical firm declined to comment.</p>
<p>((Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
